# kin/youth/neck/scarf: the youth's scarf (the A3 hero's, cut to the youth's neck): the wrap and the knot in the accent;
# the tail hangs behind at rest and flies in the side walk and run (flow, flow2), lies flat when lying
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body youth
role neck scarf
layer neck
anchor neck
keys neck

view D key rest origin 4 0
|mpnnnnom
|.mponm..

view U key rest origin 4 0
|mpoooonm

view R key rest origin 4 0
|.mpoonm
|mn.....
|.m.....

